v><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1mr2:"><div data-rid="9c96f8c7-aeab-4045-ba9f-76391745a57f" class="r-b8ed39"><div data-rid="88345687-42d0-424d-9a34-1217309a12b2" class="r-aks958 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the rare case that this happens, we’ll send you a replacement flavour for free.</p><p>If your dog doesn’t like that one either, we’ll issue a full refund, no problem.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d149ad3d-7aec-4637-b147-a5bcd87060b5" class="r-1hre5vx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="df4aa052-e689-4b5e-ada2-04e4e17109b8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1n04u48"><div data-rid="a215780e-0c04-46b9-9a18-f844ad11acc3" class="r-1iqzzh4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>At what age can my pup start using these? </p></span></div><div data-rid="178e891e-1b29-498e-a3e4-fcdf5c4220f5" class="r-1aj1pxn"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2mr2:"><div data-rid="3100229d-d2c6-4d9e-ada7-52e00466faaa" class="r-1j971qf"><div data-rid="bba38409-4737-435b-849d-435f60762f4a" class="r-8s8arh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Multivitamin is suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. However, we do recommend dogs begin to incorporate the chews into their daily routine starting at an age of 3 months or older.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6afcea30-2bca-40e0-9b15-ed7d4c375a7c" class="r-15elogk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"