 height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4mr2:"><div data-rid="2df4e7a7-2ae0-487d-a988-ee0f001552a8" class="r-13adrbb"><div data-rid="d6576cb7-1f53-4e24-a0f4-45ac38a15eea" class="r-j0gqf0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="86c55b18-797f-41f1-b5d0-679865d283d0" class="r-1m7v3to" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7cf8fc5b-b04a-4058-a8d4-2228c2465023" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1naf5k7"><div data-rid="912f56a5-22e6-443b-8496-2fbf1338aa00" class="r-14h5ogz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How many chews come in a jar? </p></span></div><div data-rid="0c90df1b-6316-4a7c-a5d0-1975be82c8ca" class="r-jh4f8n"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5mr2:"><div data-rid="4d2f50fa-26cb-4066-ba3d-2baac3cb0778" class="r-pmfrdv"><div data-rid="258662e1-fddd-4438-8a77-d49b90146365" class="r-8dkpmc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar</strong>, which is a monthly supply for all dogs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b956309e-fbba-4a79-a644-ff7cdab7e851" class="r-1opj18b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3c99681f-62c7-4996-b718-433361574019" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R6mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-oyu3vc"><div data-rid="f6a5887a-bc50-4ed4-9ff4-bfaefd7b7ef7" class="r-1w7uwip alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What flavour is the Multivitamin?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f4ce41e1-31eb-48a1-b0ef-cdd146e5acfe" class="r-bgpf6h"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R6mr2:"><div data-rid="4e5a49c6-1323-47bc-a641-d6ee3c815c3a" class="r-1v46ufv"><div data-rid="b1feadd6-32cc-47d6-b03b-7d3554396518" class="r-wl296v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade duck meat, a flavour that dogs absolutely love.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6ab62a11-25a0-4783-9ecc-32fd6e109663" class="r-rw0e67" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="aae5e868-30d4-400a-a64f-6ebc57a7501f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-uvyvp9"><div data-rid="d74480e1-9ac5-4301-b04e-3ac4acbe8b02" class="r-1ld1a18 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews? </p></span></div><div data-rid="2ea25558-42cc-4b9f-8321-a8b6c05ba021" class="r-aqa4bi"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7mr2:"><div data-rid="715714a7-c5e3-40ed-b6eb-f9c8ef5547fe" class="r-1e8owfv"><div data-rid="3ac6ebae-6e1a-429f-a694-b981823b421b" class="r-1mcrnfh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5ccdb399-39fd-4d9c-8947-31c896515e8a" class="r-grz8gf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="811c506a-8d38-46d0-9a4e-b572da02778e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R8mr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ywjxx6"><div data-rid="86d32e75-147f-47b4-ae2d-140ee3aa1b00" class="r-15iij1j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements? </p></span></div><div data-rid="43f2a8f0-d5ee-4d10-9b3d-1d2029f3931f" class="r-1qw5sj8"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R8mr2:"><div data-rid="fc2e9f86-291b-4cbc-bc60-f91db476d257" class="r-1odh1q8"><div data-rid="9229c6ae-a94e-4cde-b3d5-9f70810e7922" class="r-ff2h3l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
